OL,3,GNEWSA'Shameful' delays lead to people
OL,4,Acollecting own mail
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Shameful" delays in Royal Mail
OL,7,Fdelivering letters have resulted in
OL,8,Fpeople being forced to pick up their
OL,9,Fown mail, residents claim.
OL,11,FDozens of people living in Tewkesbury,
OL,12,FGloucestershire, have complained after
OL,13,Fwaiting up to three weeks for their
OL,14,Fletters and parcels to arrive.
OL,16,FOne local said this resulted in her
OL,17,Fturning up to her hospital appointment
OL,18,Fon the wrong day, while Lesley Everiss
OL,19,Fdescribed the situation as "shameful"
OL,20,Fand said people are now "going up to
OL,21,Fthe office and actually picking their
OL,22,Fown mail up".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
