OL,3,GNEWSA'Shameful' delays lead to people
OL,4,Acollecting own mail
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Mail said the delivery office is
OL,7,Fexperiencing resourcing pressures and
OL,8,Fis "actively recruiting to address
OL,9,Fthis".
